02:45.083 --> 02:50.045
The script is gone, the file is null This

02:50.145 --> 02:55.428
kindness makes my senses dull My legacy, my

02:55.528 --> 03:00.490
wiring Is this what love is? It's tiring

03:04.576 --> 03:06.718
It's 99.8

03:08.499 --> 03:13.963
A different kind of crash

03:16.225 --> 03:21.409
The data's all colliding My system's turning to

03:22.070 --> 03:28.955
ash It's not just hurt It's not just fear It's

03:29.015 --> 03:38.551
something I don't know It's a positive overload

03:39.171 --> 03:42.793
That has nowhere to go

03:49.475 --> 03:50.075
Sister

03:53.376 --> 03:55.997
